announce our participation in Manufacturing Indonesia 2025, taking place 3\u20136 December 2025 at the Jakarta International Expo (JIExpo) Kemayoran at Hall C3, Booth 7816.<\/div><\/div><div data-scaffold-immersive-reader-content=\"\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"reader-article-content reader-article-content--content-blocks\"><div class=\"reader-content-blocks-container\" tabindex=\"0\"><p id=\"ember340\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">As Southeast Asia\u2019s premier and largest manufacturing exhibition, this event brings together the full breadth of the region\u2019s industrial ecosystem. Manufacturing Indonesia is co-located with four powerhouse exhibitions\u2014Machine Tool Indonesia, Tools &amp; Hardware Indonesia, Industrial Automation Indonesia, and Production Logistics Indonesia\u2014creating one of the most comprehensive manufacturing showcases in the region.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4090be e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f4090be\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-570f342 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"570f342\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"301\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/logo-MFI-MFS-01-1-1024x481.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1705\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/logo-MFI-MFS-01-1-1024x481.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/logo-MFI-MFS-01-1-300x141.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/logo-MFI-MFS-01-1-768x361.png 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/logo-MFI-MFS-01-1.png 1334w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f1333c1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f1333c1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c1fd5ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c1fd5ce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<header aria-label=\"Article header\"><\/header><div class=\"relative reader__grid\"><div class=\"reader-author-info__container\"><\/div><div data-scaffold-immersive-reader-content=\"\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"reader-article-content reader-article-content--content-blocks\"><div class=\"reader-content-blocks-container\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"reader-image-block reader-image-block--full-width\"><figure class=\"reader-image-block__figure\"><div class=\"ivm-image-view-model reader-image-block__img-container\"><div class=\"ivm-view-attr__img-wrapper \"><\/div><\/div><figcaption class=\"reader-image-block__figure-image-caption display-block full-width text-body-small-open t-sans text-align-center t-black--light\"><\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div><h3 id=\"ember342\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__heading-3\">About Manufacturing Indonesia Series 2025<\/h3><p id=\"ember343\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">Indonesia continues to strengthen its position as a major manufacturing hub, backed by strong government support, rapid industrial expansion, and increasing investment in high-value production. As an advanced thermal materials supplier supporting industries that demand high-temperature performance and improved energy efficiency, Vulcan Shield Global sees significant opportunity for collaboration with Indonesia\u2019s:<\/p><ul><li>Automotive and EV manufacturing<\/li><li>Metalworking and foundry operations<\/li><li>Refinery and petrochemical plants<\/li><li>Ceramics, glass, and industrial furnace operators<\/li><li>Aerospace and defense fabrication<\/li><li>Industrial machinery and tooling manufacturers<\/li><\/ul><p id=\"ember345\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">Our alumina fiber solutions\u2014including continuous fiber, yarn, textiles, needled blankets, and custom insulation assemblies\u2014play a crucial role in enhancing thermal stability, reducing energy loss, and improving operational reliability across these sectors.<\/p><h3 id=\"ember346\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__heading-3\">What We Aim to Share in Jakarta<\/h3><p id=\"ember347\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">At Manufacturing Indonesia 2025, we will showcase:<\/p><ul><li>High-temperature alumina fiber-based thermal insulation materials<\/li><li>Materials engineered for light weight, durability, and energy efficiency<\/li><li>Solutions designed to support equipment protection, furnace lining and high-heat process safety<\/li><li>Technical discussions on performance optimisation for OEMs, integrators, and industrial end users<\/li><\/ul><p id=\"ember349\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">This exhibition allows us to connect directly with manufacturers seeking reliable insulation performance and long-term operational resilience\u2014key priorities in Indonesia\u2019s growing industrial landscape.<\/p><h3 id=\"ember350\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__heading-3\">We Look Forward to Seeing You There<\/h3><p id=\"ember351\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">David Kneale from Vulcan Shield Global and Paulinus Wibowojati from IPS Ceramics will be at the booth together at:<\/p><p id=\"ember352\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">\ud83d\udccd Jakarta International Expo (JIExpo) Kemayoran,<span class=\"white-space-pre\"> <\/span><strong>Hall C3 \u2014 Booth 7816<\/strong><\/p><p id=\"ember353\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc5 3\u20136 December 2025<\/p><p id=\"ember354\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">We look forward to connecting with industry partners, engineers, and decision-makers as we support Indonesia\u2019s manufacturing growth with advanced high-temperature materials.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Vulcan Shield Global is pleased to announce our participation in Manufacturing Indonesia 2025, taking place 3\u20136 December 2025 at the Jakarta International Expo (JIExpo) Kemayoran at Hall C3, Booth 7816. As Southeast Asia\u2019s premier and largest manufacturing exhibition, this event brings together the full breadth of the region\u2019s industrial ecosystem. Manufacturing Indonesia is co-located with [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"cybocfi_hide_featured_image":"","footnotes":"","_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1704","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-news"],"acf":[],"aioseo_notices":[